                <mxCell id="math_eq" value="x_{t+dt} = x_t + dt × v(x_t, t, K)&#xa;&#xa;Where:&#xa;  x_t = noisy trajectory at time t&#xa;  v   = velocity field (learned, depends on KV cache K)&#xa;  dt  = time step = -1/10 = -0.1&#xa;  K   = KV cache from prefix processing" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Courier New" parent="1" vertex="1">
